{"job_id":"F-64709a77a19a4d01ec32","family_id":"F-64709a77a19a4d01ec32","title":"고등법원 부장판사급 이상의 법관의 보직범위에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":30,"target_id":"dfc132276c15afa823c52f48f8e0d29bca8dd583f45f11c923e168927759c9ab","source_hash":"97e93f0f0648cc10dd61af96491d048b49dba3fd004c870afd483f24cee0013a","text":"关于高等法院及以上级别法官职务范围的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":100,"target_id":"1c0aa22065685403d83b241576d8aeb4f54aff2e7bab2dba9e0bdc36db006543","source_hash":"6eb57fdf52daa18debe91bfd74fd492c3b07dfbcd7c0d124822bd1713827b65c","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是确定各项法律、最高法院规则、内部规章、既定规则等（以下简称“法律等”）所规定的“高等法院院长及以上级别法官”的任命范围。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":100,"end":656,"target_id":"a8e7dd92d690a32a6d1368aad265985a00ae6564f329004b3901c33274bf5daa","source_hash":"3d324179ce7ee3b54aaf27b10d1b0cdd25c20ea52788c69b18400f2d9a049364","text":"第二条（适用范围） 法律等规定所称“高等法院院长及以上级别的法官”，是指下列各款所列职位的法官。但是，法律等另行规定最高法院院长及法官的，最高法院院长及法官除外。<2013年2月18日；2013年12月31日；2016年2月19日；2017年2月2日；2018年1月8日；2019年2月1日；2021年1月29日；2021年3月25日修订>\n1. 首席大法官\n2. 最高法院大法官\n3. 司法研究培训院院长兼司法政策研究所所长\n4. 各级法院首席法官\n5. 法院行政副部长\n6. 首席司法研究官 · 最高法院高级司法研究官\n7. 法院图书馆馆长\n8. 首席大法官幕僚长\n9. 法院行政办公室主任\n司法研究与培训学院高级教授、司法政策研究所高级研究员、量刑委员会常任委员\n11. 高等法院和专利法院首席法官\n12. 删除<2021.1.29>\n13. 删除<2016.2.19>\n14. 曾任第3至11号职务并被任命为司法研究培训学院教授的法官\n15. 根据第3至11条和第14条任命的法官，且自被任命到除上述职位以外的其他职位以来未满三年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":656,"end":700,"target_id":"d7a28ac247e5e1b6e7caeefc854eea2c2b0f9db80a46a49bb136e74e00c2e710","source_hash":"8cf726f8117cc09300501ee4784c8fe5be2da73d9af21ae05a21c03358bd6d4f","text":"补充规定 <第1889号，2004年5月22日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":700,"end":744,"target_id":"ba0e099fdf01886ca5ade732cf976b07f986c10e714eff42198eb93924048870","source_hash":"330780e6bd2669c541003e7f468e0b0258602fb87be653ac97c7552e59d9d063","text":"补充规定 <第2454号，2013年2月18日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":744,"end":782,"target_id":"1efe4b94c4e76c7d1455c15442314338d7eb2d319caf584bf3d46d65a3d6d947","source_hash":"0c5c237411626e983e1107060279af604513e7608f091df83f22efd7ce7efb10","text":"补充规定（司法政策研究所运作规则）<2013年12月31日第2512号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":782,"end":818,"target_id":"e1b8ba94f97b49cf89f9bc56752035805e4dab0929fe3037fcb71fa822160321","source_hash":"d227ea090c8f120e55bbec14fe16898e597456a013fa1b9d2e95b26c14ddbee5","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2014年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":818,"end":1001,"target_id":"ad634d075d85e5859bc051c1b42d9a2834a0a0ff55fe1ea33733d7a399fea95a","source_hash":"9280d7bd33882909cc0016794d49b9e318f5eedb755407abeb2ad0cb65518bb2","text":"第二条（其他规则的修改）①至⑪ 已省略\n\n  12. 对高等法院首席法官级别或以上法官任命范围规则的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第二条第三款和第十款规定如下。\n\n    3. 司法研究培训院院长兼司法政策研究所所长\n\n    10. 司法研究培训学院高级教授兼司法政策研究所高级研究员\n\n  ⑬ 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1001,"end":1046,"target_id":"71013ff374d7ce7479aa1a1b7db73423ce98bd3259f62d3dfa081f2d54374bdc","source_hash":"01305551a0bdf6e3c83ca974d68b8a5bde6e39ea5d6e79ed23a9f331039d0896","text":"补充规定 <第2648号，2016年2月19日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1046,"end":1089,"target_id":"217d3cb2fc242f3c772c05744d519d42d06ecfb2139fcecc67076f0ded5b2dac","source_hash":"0ad4ef2f89b3f79f04f13617325199298b6b4907a02e5a013d8c9fcbbfad6680","text":"补充规定 <第2719号，2017年2月2日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1089,"end":1111,"target_id":"1ba7981f35c90a9f2c13c41890a6a258ebde5afb66b638959220a483d353bab9","source_hash":"cea2d787a00f9ffa47dc5e1355efb5736842627d666240cec9e27ee51e4b5892","text":"补充规定 <第2768号，2018年1月8日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1111,"end":1141,"target_id":"20a5a897a8b7649ae47312b1d2f81c0b297ccaa05e83be2bd7251f7090e3366d","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1141,"end":1241,"target_id":"29599740c1e433d38b964cb5d4d3d2598dfbcfa504ace10d2e1af492bb3fbf3d","source_hash":"54452391d0f05646779a66c7c6b17c098acb404f5100b2c412ec5d3586c642f5","text":"第二条（过渡措施）在本规则实施之前，根据先前规定任命为高等法院院长或更高级别法官的，应视为根据先前规定担任高等法院院长或更高级别法官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1241,"end":1263,"target_id":"d808f277fc2a7e741d075b63edc47d4759222163e5e2ed68cd7f33d4509088b1","source_hash":"e7e6448829ad900c4a7fe985314bc0b66c893cfd09f4796068d5dbd49b8a578d","text":"补充规定 <第2831号，2019年2月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1263,"end":1314,"target_id":"8fd34c409f17747e85fc3bc30625980c7476718c400fbde96dbcb34ffe3ae9c3","source_hash":"c745609eedc4a429ee9367dd8860bc55641b1a50947c50d60b637a253d5509a7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效，但自2019年2月14日起适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1314,"end":1383,"target_id":"2d2737cd4fe45574a83a95c528a98cba6e809840c41621af23cbdc735d4f95c1","source_hash":"0ae053997827170eb1b9a8cc17dafdd2ef1fd0e495dc722c01fa2c42d04009ac","text":"第二条（过渡措施）在本规则实施前担任地方法院审判长期间被任命为各级法院首席法官的法官，适用以前的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009703-230581-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1383,"end":1428,"target_id":"b84f92b58fbe3acfb999ef24b67df77a879f10c8a85a70ddee5b45c42942980c","source_hash":"3842c3ece5a6b77026d4ad06d621fb91fa435e5c7230cf31571c6e77ed9d26dc